sequenceDiagram
    participant Device as Requesting Device
    participant Scanner as Scan Callback
    participant RTC as RTC Time Source
    participant Sync as Time Sync Handler
    participant Response as Response Generator
    
    Note over Device: ⏰ RTC时间同步流程
    
    Device->>Scanner: Send time sync request<br/>(message_type=0x30)
    Scanner->>RTC: get_synced_rtc_time()
    
    Note over RTC: 🕐 Time synchronization
    RTC->>RTC: Read hardware RTC
    RTC->>RTC: Apply sync offset corrections
    RTC->>RTC: Calculate precision confidence
    
    RTC-->>Scanner: Current synchronized time<br/>+ confidence level
    
    Scanner->>Sync: validate_time_quality()
    Sync->>Sync: Check if confidence >= 200
    Sync->>Sync: Verify time stability
    
    alt High Quality Time Available
        Sync-->>Scanner: ✅ Time quality verified
        Scanner->>Response: prepare_time_response()
        Response->>Response: Format response data<br/>(rtc_time, confidence, sync_id)
        Response-->>Scanner: Time sync response ready
        Scanner-->>Device: ✅ Time sync successful<br/>Current time + confidence
        
    else Time Quality Insufficient
        Sync-->>Scanner: ❌ Time quality poor
        Scanner-->>Device: ❌ Time sync unavailable<br/>Please retry later
    end
    
    Note over Scanner: 📊 Sync statistics updated